# Build context minimizer for `gcloud builds submit` (context = mlops).
#
# The image needs the package itself (data/, training/, evaluation/, serving/),
# the Dockerfile, and the one artifact that is read inside the container.
# Everything below is excluded to keep the uploaded context small and to avoid
# walking heavy / non-source directories (artifacts/ also contains a
# self-referential symlink that crashes the uploader).

# Artifacts: the missingness policy is read at run time by mlops/data/config.py,
# and the HOSPITAL baseline by the gates (mlops/training/components/_baselines.py)
# — a gate that receives its threshold as a parameter can have it weakened at
# submit time, so the value travels in the image instead. The rest are run
# outputs (feature-selection reports, validation reports).
artifacts/*
!artifacts/missingness_policy.csv
!artifacts/hospital_baseline.json
notebooks/
docs/

# Tests are not needed inside the images
training/tests/

# Python / tooling cruft
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.ipynb
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.DS_Store
